Note on third-party data used by this project (not redistributed here):
`src/exp1_realworld_validation.py` reads real AWS-managed IAM policy
documents from Salesforce's Cloudsplaining project (Apache-2.0 licensed),
cloned separately per the instructions in README.md. Those policy documents
are AWS's own public IAM policy definitions, not Cloudsplaining's or this
project's intellectual property. See VERIFIED_REFERENCES.md for full
attribution of all external data and reference sources used.
